<title>POLAND: STALEXPORT NOV NET TURNS TO LOSS.</title>
<headline>STALEXPORT NOV NET TURNS TO LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net	 loss	 0.55 vs   3.78 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax   loss	 0.22 vs   7.20 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.03 vs   7.45</p>
<p> Sales		  133.10 vs 151.17</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    23.66 vs     45.89</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	40.70 vs     68.69</p>
<p> Operating profit    38.55 vs     37.37</p>
<p> Sales		1,473.25 vs  1,711.88</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish steel trader is Stalexport SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
